2.6 AI Model Requirements

Gemini Flash: Generates a structured five-panel comic outline.

Gemini Pro: Expands the outline into detailed narration and character dialogues.

Stable Diffusion: Generates comic-style illustrations from image prompts.

The uploaded document refers to Gemini 1.5 Flash, Gemini 1.5 Pro, and Stable Diffusion 1.5 as its selected models. Actual availability and compatibility should be checked during implementation.

2.7 Feasibility Study

Technical Feasibility: The project uses Python-based web development tools and AI model integrations described in the project document.

Operational Feasibility: Users can interact with the application through a web browser without needing illustration software or advanced drawing skills.

Economic Feasibility: Open-source development tools and available AI service plans can be used. However, API usage, cloud computing, and image generation may involve costs.

Time Feasibility: The modular development approach allows the project to be divided into smaller tasks and completed phase-by-phase.

2.8 Expected Result

The requirement analysis defines the technical foundation and features needed to develop a web application that generates personalized comic stories, illustrations, previews, and PDF files.
